# 2. FEATURE OBJECTIVE

Implement an intelligent, consent-based Call Watcher that identifies potentially suspicious relationships between incoming calls and subsequent financial activity.

The system must:

- Activate after one-time user consent.
- Automatically monitor supported call events.
- Automatically monitor payment-related SMS where Android permissions and distribution policies allow.
- Never listen to call audio.
- Never record calls.
- Never transcribe conversations.
- Analyse call metadata and payment-message information.
- Identify suspicious patterns and unusual timing relationships.
- Ask the student a few safety questions when an unknown caller is involved and a relevant event warrants follow-up.
- Notify both the student and linked parent.
- Maintain an understandable chronological safety timeline.

The primary objective is to identify potential social engineering, payment fraud, impersonation, and coercive financial activity.

The system must never claim that a call caused a payment merely because the events happened close together.

